{"4431860":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Hex Seculum","steam_appid":4431860,"required_age":0,"is_free":true,"dlc":[5340700,5340710,5340730],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gold only turns into experience if you bring it home.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hex Seculum is a free RPG inspired by old school RPG rulesets. Lead a fragile party across a hex map, follow rumors into dungeons where the torches run out, and fight turn-based battles where position decides who walks out. Play alone, or bring up to three friends online.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4431860\/extras\/ffa90fa6a48ffa22487495523cd9cefd.avif?t=1793724538\" width=1232 height=128 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day your party gets a handful of action points. Spend them to travel, explore a hex, forage, search for a hidden dungeon or work a town for rumors. Rations, water and torches run down as the days pass, and the farther you go from home, the meaner the land gets.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plains, forests, hills, mountains, swamps and deserts, revealed hex by hex as you explore<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>118 wilderness events<\/strong> with illustrated scenes and choices that test your heroes' abilities<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>123 rumors<\/strong> that turn into contracts and map markers in your journal<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Settlements with shops, inns and retainers for hire<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4431860\/extras\/f60aedebaf96b8dd241ab8c1bb2914bc.avif?t=1793724538\" width=1232 height=128 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4431860\/extras\/a43cfe865ff2e43a22d56301c9595aae.poster.avif?t=1793724538\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4431860\/extras\/a43cfe865ff2e43a22d56301c9595aae.webm?t=1793724538\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4431860\/extras\/a43cfe865ff2e43a22d56301c9595aae.mp4?t=1793724538\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every dungeon is generated fresh, floor after floor. Underground, every ten minutes counts: torches burn out, wandering monsters come looking, and a party that never rests starts to stumble.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traps, secret doors, barricades and puzzles you can solve, force or leave alone<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters check their morale, run away, or stop to parley before swords are drawn<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4431860\/extras\/e1ed16a8224acc68de55130f290c7a7d.avif?t=1793724538\" width=1232 height=128 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4431860\/extras\/cba5bcaffe7e5d59312dd892ff16c49b.poster.avif?t=1793724538\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4431860\/extras\/cba5bcaffe7e5d59312dd892ff16c49b.webm?t=1793724538\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4431860\/extras\/cba5bcaffe7e5d59312dd892ff16c49b.mp4?t=1793724538\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles play out across six lanes. Each hero gets one move and one action per turn. Melee needs reach, arrows lose accuracy over distance, and a wizard caught in the front lane will not last long. Set your marching order before trouble starts: the dwarf in front, the wizard behind.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30 monsters<\/strong>, from kobolds and wolves to five breeds of dragon<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 30 arcane and divine spells<\/strong>, Fireball and Magic Missiles included<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heroes at 0 HP go down before they die, so there is still time to drag them out<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4431860\/extras\/9c4a51d1ef6684f5c2734bc520f32456.avif?t=1793724538\" width=1232 height=128 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4431860\/extras\/38e6abb2833c65d97cc3477256cadfff.poster.avif?t=1793724538\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4431860\/extras\/38e6abb2833c65d97cc3477256cadfff.webm?t=1793724538\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4431860\/extras\/38e6abb2833c65d97cc3477256cadfff.mp4?t=1793724538\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your table online. Two to four players share one campaign, each playing their own hero.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite Steam friends, share a 6-character join code, or open a public lobby for quick join<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every player creates and controls their own hero<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The party votes on travel, events, dungeons and retreats. The majority wins and the host breaks ties<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action points are split fairly every day<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If someone drops, another player covers their hero until they are back<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a hero falls, their player builds a new one and rejoins at dawn in a settlement<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Text chat built in. The host keeps the save<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4431860\/extras\/279c9244c23f3d1aa44d691c728c7006.avif?t=1793724538\" width=1232 height=128 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4431860\/extras\/49b08c579ae1323eb83fecb741cb8304.avif?t=1793724538\" width=1232 height=464 \/><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 races and 4 classes<\/strong>: Fighter, Cleric, Wizard and Rogue. Roll your scores 3d6 or 4d6 drop lowest<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 180 magic items<\/strong>, from a Bag of Holding to the Vorpal Sword<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 deities with their own domains for your clerics<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire retainers, and promote a loyal one to a full hero<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At high level, build strongholds, wizard towers and temples, raise armies and deal with rival factions<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An endless campaign: milestones reshape the world, and there is no final boss to beat<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ironman saves. At the start, choose whether a wiped party ends the campaign or a new party carries on in the same world<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gold only turns into experience if you bring it home.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hex Seculum is a free RPG inspired by old school RPG rulesets. Lead a fragile party across a hex map, follow rumors into dungeons where the torches run out, and fight turn-based battles where position decides who walks out. Play alone, or bring up to three friends online.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4431860\/extras\/ffa90fa6a48ffa22487495523cd9cefd.avif?t=1793724538\" width=1232 height=128 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day your party gets a handful of action points. Spend them to travel, explore a hex, forage, search for a hidden dungeon or work a town for rumors. Rations, water and torches run down as the days pass, and the farther you go from home, the meaner the land gets.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plains, forests, hills, mountains, swamps and deserts, revealed hex by hex as you explore<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>118 wilderness events<\/strong> with illustrated scenes and choices that test your heroes' abilities<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>123 rumors<\/strong> that turn into contracts and map markers in your journal<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Settlements with shops, inns and retainers for hire<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4431860\/extras\/f60aedebaf96b8dd241ab8c1bb2914bc.avif?t=1793724538\" width=1232 height=128 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4431860\/extras\/a43cfe865ff2e43a22d56301c9595aae.poster.avif?t=1793724538\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4431860\/extras\/a43cfe865ff2e43a22d56301c9595aae.webm?t=1793724538\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4431860\/extras\/a43cfe865ff2e43a22d56301c9595aae.mp4?t=1793724538\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every dungeon is generated fresh, floor after floor. Underground, every ten minutes counts: torches burn out, wandering monsters come looking, and a party that never rests starts to stumble.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traps, secret doors, barricades and puzzles you can solve, force or leave alone<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters check their morale, run away, or stop to parley before swords are drawn<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4431860\/extras\/e1ed16a8224acc68de55130f290c7a7d.avif?t=1793724538\" width=1232 height=128 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4431860\/extras\/cba5bcaffe7e5d59312dd892ff16c49b.poster.avif?t=1793724538\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4431860\/extras\/cba5bcaffe7e5d59312dd892ff16c49b.webm?t=1793724538\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4431860\/extras\/cba5bcaffe7e5d59312dd892ff16c49b.mp4?t=1793724538\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles play out across six lanes. Each hero gets one move and one action per turn. Melee needs reach, arrows lose accuracy over distance, and a wizard caught in the front lane will not last long. Set your marching order before trouble starts: the dwarf in front, the wizard behind.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30 monsters<\/strong>, from kobolds and wolves to five breeds of dragon<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 30 arcane and divine spells<\/strong>, Fireball and Magic Missiles included<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heroes at 0 HP go down before they die, so there is still time to drag them out<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4431860\/extras\/9c4a51d1ef6684f5c2734bc520f32456.avif?t=1793724538\" width=1232 height=128 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4431860\/extras\/38e6abb2833c65d97cc3477256cadfff.poster.avif?t=1793724538\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4431860\/extras\/38e6abb2833c65d97cc3477256cadfff.webm?t=1793724538\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4431860\/extras\/38e6abb2833c65d97cc3477256cadfff.mp4?t=1793724538\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your table online. Two to four players share one campaign, each playing their own hero.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite Steam friends, share a 6-character join code, or open a public lobby for quick join<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every player creates and controls their own hero<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The party votes on travel, events, dungeons and retreats. The majority wins and the host breaks ties<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action points are split fairly every day<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If someone drops, another player covers their hero until they are back<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a hero falls, their player builds a new one and rejoins at dawn in a settlement<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Text chat built in. The host keeps the save<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4431860\/extras\/279c9244c23f3d1aa44d691c728c7006.avif?t=1793724538\" width=1232 height=128 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4431860\/extras\/49b08c579ae1323eb83fecb741cb8304.avif?t=1793724538\" width=1232 height=464 \/><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 races and 4 classes<\/strong>: Fighter, Cleric, Wizard and Rogue. Roll your scores 3d6 or 4d6 drop lowest<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 180 magic items<\/strong>, from a Bag of Holding to the Vorpal Sword<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 deities with their own domains for your clerics<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire retainers, and promote a loyal one to a full hero<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At high level, build strongholds, wizard towers and temples, raise armies and deal with rival factions<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An endless campaign: milestones reshape the world, and there is no final boss to beat<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ironman saves. At the start, choose whether a wiped party ends the campaign or a new party carries on in the same world<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"Explore a perilous hex map, delve into tense dungeons where time and torchlight run out, and fight turn-based battles where distance and positioning decide survival. Plan your expedition, manage supplies, and escape with treasure.","supported_languages":"English, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4431860\/bef998adb2eec94ae383ca07bb325db9a832c8e5\/header.jpg?t=1793724538","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4431860\/b79e4df6c171dba46925f2aeab35c2ac2248ea64\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793724538","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4431860\/b79e4df6c171dba46925f2aeab35c2ac2248ea64\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793724538","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:<\/strong> Windows 7 (SP1+), Windows 10 and Windows 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> x86, x64 architecture with SSE2 instruction set support.<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 6 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> DX10, DX11, DX12 capable.<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["Crit42 Studio"],"publishers":["Crit42 Studio"],"package_groups":[],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":1,"description":"Multi-player"},{"id":9,"description":"Co-op"},{"id":38,"description":"Online Co-op"},{"id":62,"descri